comment2.params=
comment2.target=void\ accordingAsGaShouldKeepTheSameNumberOfWheelsAfterASwap()
comment2.text=\r\n\ Al\ intercambiar\ dos\ ruedas,\ la\ maquina\ debe\ seguir\ teniendo\ el\ mismo\r\n\ numero\ de\ ruedas\ (swap\ no\ debe\ agregar\ ni\ perder\ ruedas).\r\n
comment3.params=
comment3.target=void\ accordingAsGaShouldNotChangeALockedWheelWhenSpinning()
comment3.text=\r\n\ Una\ rueda\ fija\ no\ debe\ cambiar\ su\ simbolo\ al\ frente,\ ni\ con\r\n\ spin(wheel)\ ni\ con\ spin(wheel,steps).\r\n
